# Wave T51 (Astral kit): ringstone — a weathered standing stone with a carved ring, one of the shrine ring's stones: the OLD SHRINE sign's own words ('Three small shrines in a ring of stones') and the Backstory Sync Audit's Astral row ('moon, star and leaf shrines in their stone ring'), realized as dressing at the shrine plaza's north gate — the pair flanks the plaza avenue's entry; the shipped shrine/stonebell/originstone dressing stands byte-kept where the backend put it, and no shrine figure or event is invented. Fully opaque: the town grass is baked in at the MEASURED tg-celestic colours (#1b812b base, #1b4b2b speckle). (WAVE-T51-ASTRAL-PLAN.md §5.)
